<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n113421" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χάρμη</span></b>  (A), ἡ, prop.
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>joy of battle, lust of
				battle,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χάρμῃ γηθόσυνοι τήν σφιν θεὸς ἔμβαλε
					θυμῷ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					13.82
				</span></i>
			; once in <i><span class="en">
				Od.
			</span></i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μνησώμεθα χάρμης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					22.73
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				4.222
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				8.252
			</span></i>, al.; opp. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λήθετο χάρμης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					12.203
				</span></i>
			,<i><span class="en">
				393
			</span></i>, etc.: pl., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δύο χάρμαι</span> two
				<i>battle-joys,</i> i.e. <i>victories,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>O.</u>
				9.86
			</span></i>; <i>successes,</i> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κακά,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ps.-Phoc.
				118
			</span></i>: but, </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>battle,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προκαλέσσατο χάρμῃ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					7.218
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔλθοι τεθνηώς, καί μιν ἐρυσαίμεθα
					χάρμης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					17.161
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰδότε χάρμης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					5.608
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μηδ᾽ εἴκετε χάρμης Ἀργείοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					4.509
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παῦσαί τινα χάρμης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					12.389
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐρωήσουσι δὲ χάρμης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					14.101
				</span></i>
			.</div>
